=09
		<span>Choosing the Right WiFi Solution for You</span>

=09
</span>		</h2>

			=09

<div class=3D"page-body se" id=3D"page5" data-slide=3D"5" data-track-gtm=3D=
"Content" x-show.transition=3D"pageVisible =3D=3D=3D true">=09



=09
		<p>When deciding between a WiFi extender and a WiFi booster (aka wireless=
 range extender), consider the following factors.</p>

	=09
=09
			=09
			=09
			=09


=09
		<div class=3D"list">
	<ol><li><span><b>Check your existing signal strength.</b> WiFi extenders f=
ocus on providing a more stable connection overall. WiFi boosters improve b=
andwidth and signal strength, but the quality of the signal received by the=
 WiFi repeater is the same as the signal distributed.</span></li><li><span>=
<b>Consider the size of the area to cover.</b> WiFi extenders can provide <=
a href=3D"https://computer.howstuffworks.com/home-network.htm">wireless net=
work</a> extension with MoCA technology, improving coverage and signal stre=
ngth. WiFi boosters can extend a WiFi signal to cover a larger area, but mu=
ltiple units may be necessary.</span></li><li><span><b>Evaluate how many de=
vices you need.</b> Think about the number of WiFi devices that need to con=
nect to your network and their capabilities.</span></li></ol>
</div>


	=09
=09
=09
			=09
			=09
	=09

