	<figcaption class=3D"media-body-wrap bg-accent-3 p-4 w-max-full text-sm te=
xt-left">
											Smartphones, tablets, smart TVs and laptops all access the inter=
net with the help of a router (the device pictured with two antennas). <spa=
n class=3D"uppercase text-xs text-brown">pictafolio/Getty Images</span>
								</figcaption>

	</figure>
